# AGENT.md — src/

Application root. Architecture: **{{architectureLabel}}**.

## What lives here

- `main.ts` — bootstrap only. Global pipes, prefixes, and `listen()`.
- `app.module.ts` — the module registry. Every feature module must be
  imported here.
- `config/` — environment loading and global pipes.
- `shared/` — cross-cutting infrastructure (database, cache, messaging)
  used by more than one module.

## Rules

- Do not put business logic in `main.ts` or `app.module.ts`.
- Anything specific to one feature belongs in that feature's directories,
  not in `shared/`.
- When you add a new feature module, add its import to `app.module.ts` in
  the same change — a module that isn't registered silently does nothing.
